OL,3,AEarly Bowie music available to stream
OL,4,Afor first time
OL,5,
OL,6,FTen years ago Alec Palao was casually
OL,7,Fflicking through a collection of old
OL,8,Frecords when he noticed some faint
OL,9,Fpencil markings that were enough to
OL,10,Fdraw a gasp. "Davie Jones," it read.
OL,12,FWhat he had found was musical gold:
OL,13,Ffive unreleased songs by a young David
OL,14,FBowie, filed away under his birth name.
OL,16,FFrom Friday, those tracks, plus another
OL,17,Ffive unreleased songs that came Palao's
OL,18,Fway after the initial discovery, will
OL,19,Fbe available to buy and stream.
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
FL,170,160,200,105,0,100
